OL,3,GNEWSAHealth minister apologises to
OL,4,Apatients over neurology failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth Minister Robbie Butler has
OL,7,Fapologised for failings in the care of
OL,8,Fpatients of former Belfast neurologist
OL,9,FMichael Watt.
OL,11,FThe apology follows the publication of
OL,12,Fa final review into the care of
OL,13,Fpatients who had died.
OL,15,FButler said meeting the families and
OL,16,Floved ones of some of Watt's deceased
OL,17,Fpatients had been an "unrivalled
OL,18,Fprivilege".
OL,20,FHe said they were still living with the
OL,21,F"pain and trauma" of what had happened.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
